[node name="Desc" type="RichTextLabel" parent="AboutDialog/Panel/VBox"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]Mekatilili wa Menza: A Kenyan Historical Adventure[/b]

This game is dedicated to honoring the courage and memory of [b]Mekatilili wa Menza[/b] and the Agiriama people who defended their land, cultural freedom, and people against British colonial subjugation in 1913–1914.

[color=#D9A441]Principles:[/color]
• Authentic Kenyan coastal history
• Preservation of sacred Kaya traditions
• Community solidarity and resilience"

